WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.950
Welcome to the Federal
Modernization Workbook's

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.638
developer workbook,
Building Azure Security.

3
00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:09.576
This is Chapter 9: deploying
to test and production.

4
00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:12.223
The kit reads every week and writes once,

5
00:00:12.223 --> 00:00:15.913
so this runbook is about the
week, and about the one write.

6
00:00:15.913 --> 00:00:20.444
It takes the kit from the labs to a live
test subscription, then to production,

7
00:00:20.444 --> 00:00:24.112
with the same commands and one
settings file per environment.

8
00:00:24.112 --> 00:00:27.099
The chapter has been
reviewed and approved,

9
00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:31.081
and nothing in it has been run
against a live subscription;

10
00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:35.780
the output you'll see comes from
fixture mode, dated November 17, 2026.
